    "A browser session failed to start because the iTerm2 Browser Plugin couldn’t be found.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "浏览器会话启动失败，因为找不到 iTerm2 浏览器插件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A companion device is paired and connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配对并连接 Companion 设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A companion device is paired but iTerm2 isn’t listening for it yet. Reconnecting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Companion 设备已配对，但 iTerm2 尚未开始监听。正在重新连接…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A companion device is paired. Waiting for it to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Companion 设备已配对。正在等待其连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A control sequence attempted to activate a session. Allow it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制序列试图激活会话。允许吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A file with the name “\\(descriptor.absolutePath.lastPathComponent)” on \\(descriptor.sshIdentity.displayName) already exists in this location. Do you want to replace it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\\(descriptor.sshIdentity.displayName) 上名为“\\(descriptor.absolutePath.lastPathComponent)”的文件已存在于该位置。要替换它吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A keyboard shortcut didn’t run because this physical key now produces a different character than it did when the shortcut was created, usually after switching keyboard layout or input method. Matching key bindings by physical key makes shortcuts work regardless of the character a key produces. This affects all key bindings; you can change it later in Settings > Keys.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键盘快捷键未执行，因为此物理按键现在产生的字符与创建快捷键时不同，通常发生在切换键盘布局或输入法之后。按物理按键匹配按键绑定可使快捷键不依赖按键产生的字符而正常工作。这会影响所有按键绑定；你可以在“设置 > 键盘”中稍后更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A script named “%@” is already installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装名为“%@”的脚本"
