    "In order to use the LastPass integration, iTerm2 needs to know where to find the CLI app named “lpass”. Select Locate to provide its location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要使用 LastPass 集成，iTerm2 需要知道名为“lpass”的 CLI 应用的位置。选择“定位”以提供其位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the iTerm2 Buddy app on your iPhone, tap Scan and point the camera at this code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 上的 iTerm2 Buddy 应用中，轻点“扫描”并将相机对准此代码。"
