    "Uploading \\u{201C}\\(filename)\\u{201D}…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在上传“\\(filename)”…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uploads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use .%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 .%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Default App": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用默认应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Default Browser": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用默认浏览器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Default Profile": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用默认配置文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Physical Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用物理按键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Settings Folder’s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用设置文件夹的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use System Panel…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用系统面板…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use This Mac’s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用这台 Mac 的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use _ Instead of Space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 _ 代替空格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Username": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verify": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version 2 of the OnePassword CLI could not be found. Check that \\(OnePasswordUtils.pathToCLI) is installed and has version 2.x.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到 1Password CLI 版本 2。请检查 \\(OnePasswordUtils.pathToCLI) 已安装且为 2.x 版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View Source": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看源代码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Viewing archived clippings (\\(historyIndex + 1) of \\(total))": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在查看已归档的剪贴（\\(historyIndex + 1) / \\(total)）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warning! This profile uses a custom locale that doesn't use UTF-8 as its character encoding, but your profile *is* using UTF-8. This can cause error messages and non-ASCII text to appear wrong.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告！此配置文件使用的自定义语言环境不使用 UTF-8 作为字符编码，但你的配置文件*确实*使用 UTF-8。这可能导致错误消息和非 ASCII 文本显示异常。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Web Page Alert": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网页提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Web Page Confirmation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网页确认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Web Site": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What are you trying to do? I'll suggest commands and explain their output.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你想做什么？我会建议命令并解释其输出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What dependency would you like to add?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你想添加哪个依赖项？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What gets changed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将更改什么"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is a Workgroup?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "什么是工作组？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, only the most recent status from each workgroup is shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，仅显示每个工作组的最新状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When iTerm2 is excluded from the dock, you can always get back to Preferences using the status bar item. Look for an iTerm2 icon on the right side of your menu bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当 iTerm2 从 Dock 中排除时，你始终可以通过状态栏项目回到“设置”。请查看菜单栏右侧的 iTerm2 图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When set, the trigger fires only for the workgroup leader (the session that originally entered the workgroup). Peers such as the Code Review and Diff sessions do not, so reloading or quitting one keeps the workgroup open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置后，触发器仅在工作组主导者（最初进入工作组的会话）上触发。代码审查和差异等对等会话不会触发，因此重新载入或退出其中一个会话不会关闭工作组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you activate Semantic History on a filename, the associated app loads the file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当你在文件名上启用语义历史记录时，关联的应用会载入该文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you activate Semantic History on a text file, the specified editor opens it.\\nOther kinds of files will be opened with their default apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当你在文本文件上启用语义历史记录时，指定的编辑器会打开它。\\n其他类型的文件将用默认应用打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you check “Remember my choice” or “Suppress this message ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当你勾选“记住我的选择”或“抑制此消息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where would you like to save this download?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你想将此下载存储到哪里？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While attaching to tmux, some tabs were found whose color is pure red. This may be due to a bug in early versions of iTerm2 3.6.x. Would you like to reset those tabs’ colors?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附加到 tmux 时，发现某些标签页的颜色为纯红色。这可能是 iTerm2 3.6.x 早期版本中的 bug 所致。要重置这些标签页的颜色吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While loading %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "载入 %@ 时：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While parsing %@: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解析 %@ 时：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workgroup name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作组名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also try opening a terminal window and running `lpass login \\(email)`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你也可以尝试打开终端窗口并运行 `lpass login \\(email)`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can choose to use both, so that your file name ends in “.%@.%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以选择同时使用两者，这样文件名将以“.%@.%@”结尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can find this feature under Edit > Replace Selection > Replace with Pretty-Printed JSON if you want to use it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你想再次使用此功能，可以在“编辑 > 替换所选内容 > 替换为格式化 JSON”下找到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can use captured strings from the Smart Selection's regular expression in the parameter. Use \\\\0 for match, \\\\1…\\\\9 for match groups, \\\\d for directory, \\\\u for user, \\\\h for host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可以在参数中使用智能选择正则表达式捕获的字符串。使用 \\\\0 表示匹配项，\\\\1…\\\\9 表示匹配组，\\\\d 表示目录，\\\\u 表示用户，\\\\h 表示主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't customize that button": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你不能自定义该按钮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have asked to downgrade to an older Python version. Dependencies will need to be reinstalled. This may go badly. Are you sure you want to do this?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已请求降级到较旧的 Python 版本。依赖项需要重新安装。这可能不太顺利。确定要这样做吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have asked to upgrade to a newer Python version. Dependencies will need to be reinstalled. OK to continue?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已请求升级到较新的 Python 版本。依赖项需要重新安装。继续吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have chosen to have an option key act as Meta. This option is useful for backward compatibility with older systems. The \\": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已选择让选项键充当 Meta。此选项有助于与较旧系统的向后兼容。\\"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must enable AI features to use Codecierge.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你必须启用 AI 功能才能使用 Codecierge。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must install Rosetta 2 in order to use the Python API. Install it now?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要使用 Python API，你必须安装 Rosetta 2。立即安装？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must restart iTerm2 for this change to take effect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你必须重启 iTerm2 才能使此更改生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must restart iTerm2 to turn on this feature.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你必须重启 iTerm2 才能开启此功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need an open terminal window to make a screenshot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你需要一个打开的终端窗口才能截屏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You probably don’t want to turn this on. It will confuse interactive programs. You might want it if you work mostly with East Asian text combined with legacy or mathematical character sets. Are you sure you want this?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可能不想开启这个。它会混淆交互式程序。如果你主要处理结合了传统或数学字符集的东亚文本，你可能会需要它。确定要这样吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You probably don’t want to turn this on. It's not suitable for keeping ssh sessions alive, even with a code of “0”. Are you sure you want this?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你可能不想开启这个。它不适合保持 ssh 会话存活，即使使用代码“0”也是如此。确定要这样吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're about to paste a string with tabs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你即将粘贴包含制表符的字符串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your companion device is paired and connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Companion 设备已配对并连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your companion device is paired but iTerm2 isn’t listening for it yet. Reconnecting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Companion 设备已配对，但 iTerm2 尚未开始监听。正在重新连接…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your companion device is paired. Waiting for it to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Companion 设备已配对。正在等待其连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re up to date!": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已是最新版本！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "[%d profiles not shown]": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[未显示 %d 个配置文件]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\\(detail) Continue removing the ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\\(detail) 继续移除 "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\\(name) changed from “\\(fromText)” to “\\(toText)”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\\(name) 已从“\\(fromText)”更改为“\\(toText)”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\\(providerName) doesn’t accept this file type as a chat attachment: \\(names).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\\(providerName) 不接受此文件类型作为聊天附件：\\(names)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "_Allow Once": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "_允许一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "_No": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "_否"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "_Restart": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "_重启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "_Temporarily": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "_暂时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "_Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "_是"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "columns by": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列乘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 Companion plugin installed and working ✅": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 Companion 插件已安装且工作正常 ✅"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 Companion plugin not installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 Companion 插件未安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 Needs an Update": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 需要更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 can display files like this in its built-in web browser! Would you like to open this link in iTerm2?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 可以在其内置网页浏览器中显示此类文件！要在 iTerm2 中打开此链接吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 can display web pages! But first you must download the Browser Plugin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 可以显示网页！但首先你必须下载浏览器插件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 can display web pages! Would you like to open this link in iTerm2?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 可以显示网页！要在 iTerm2 中打开此链接吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 cannot watch the job \\(displayName) with process ID \\(pid) because it has already terminated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 无法监视进程 ID 为 \\(pid) 的任务 \\(displayName)，因为它已经终止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 has moved to the new relay. For your Mac and iPhone to keep connecting, ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 已迁移到新中继。为了让你的 Mac 和 iPhone 保持连接，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2 no longer warns before a multi-line paste, unless you are at the shell prompt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 不再在粘贴多行前发出警告，除非你位于 Shell 提示符处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iTerm2\\u{2019}s cc-status hook is no longer in ~/.claude/settings.json. This usually means Claude Code rewrote that file. Reinstall the hook so per-tab status indicators (\\u{201C}Working\\u{2026},\\u{201D} \\u{201C}Waiting\\u{2026}\\u{201D}) work again?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iTerm2 的 cc-status 钩子已不在 ~/.claude/settings.json 中。这通常意味着 Claude Code 重写了该文件。重新安装钩子，以便每个标签页的状态指示器（“正在处理…”、“正在等待…”）重新工作？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "modifyOtherKeys Mode 1": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "modifyOtherKeys 模式 1"
          }
        }
      }
    },
